om $246 million a year earlier.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1,\u0022facts\u0022:true},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Management raised its outlook and guided fourth quarter revenue to $1.93 billion to $1.95 billion and non-GAAP earnings per share to $3.34 to $3.40 on about 172 million shares.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1,\u0022facts\u0022:true},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The guidance sits well above analyst consensus for both revenue and earnings, which leaves room for estimates to be revised up.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:2,\u0022facts\u0022:false},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Operating margin exceeded the long-term target range and integration work finished ahead of schedule, with most of the targeted cost synergies expected on a run rate basis by year end.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3,\u0022facts\u0022:false},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The bull case needs the next report to show fourth quarter revenue and earnings per share inside or above the guided ranges while orders stay at record levels.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3,\u0022facts\u0022:false}],[{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The bear case starts with supply, because management said the supply chain will remain the governor of near-term revenue, that conversion of demand into revenue will be nonlinear, and that the supply environment is less flexible than a year ago.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3,\u0022facts\u0022:false},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The chief financial officer also warned that one-time tariff impacts lifted fiscal 2026 profitability and will not repeat, which raises the bar for margins from here.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3,\u0022facts\u0022:false},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Management\\u0027s base case is orders only slightly up from the third quarter, and analysts questioned the modest sequential step in the fourth quarter revenue guide.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3,\u0022facts\u0022:false},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022GAAP net income of $397 million sits well below the adjusted figure, because acquisition amortization, share-based compensation and integration costs are excluded from non-GAAP results.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1,\u0022facts\u0022:true},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Shares had risen in pre-market trading on the report, yet the next session closed 6.32% lower and the stock fell 13.98% over the five sessions to 2026-08-24, a sign that good news was already priced in.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:2,\u0022facts\u0022:true},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Analyst tone on the call was slightly negative, with repeated questions on whether demand is sustainable and whether supply limits guidance.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3,\u0022facts\u0022:false},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The bear case needs the next report to show revenue held back by component supply, orders slipping from the record level, or margins giving back the tariff-aided gain.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3,\u0022facts\u0022:false}]]}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":27165,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4712,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3845},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}}